WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.107 --> 00:00:05.499
AppShelf sells hosted WordPress sites, billed with Stripe.

2
00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:09.047
Pick one of three templates.

3
00:00:10.923 --> 00:00:14.455
Sign up in seconds. There's no email check in this demo.

4
00:00:15.123 --> 00:00:17.977
Choose a template, name the site, and pick its address.

5
00:00:20.555 --> 00:00:23.105
Then pay on Stripe Checkout with the test card.

6
00:00:26.355 --> 00:00:29.790
Stripe sends a webhook, and a worker builds the WordPress site.

7
00:00:30.955 --> 00:00:32.243
And it's live.

8
00:00:33.578 --> 00:00:36.264
Here's the new restaurant site, ready to edit.

9
00:00:38.839 --> 00:00:41.920
Cancel the plan, and the licence turns inactive.

10
00:00:43.439 --> 00:00:45.685
Visitors now see an archived site.

11
00:00:46.443 --> 00:00:48.361
Renew with the same test card.

12
00:00:53.058 --> 00:00:55.273
Seconds later, it's back online.

13
00:00:56.458 --> 00:00:58.433
Same site, same content.

14
00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:04.190
Built with Next.js, Postgres, Stripe and WordPress.
